  "cover_text": "These Card Characters are a new range of LogoBugs that can be used as party cards or presentation cards and can bring a fun colour scheme to the deck.\nThe 3 card characters are available in a semi-finished look with a 2mm glossy card cut and various embossing styles. Mud boxes, paint and glitter features can be added but they will pose a risk to the card paper.\nLearning Items features, for each card item include the symbolism, an image, a category, a quote and a shopping list. Each letter of the alphabet have a unique symbol, wow",
